+6. To deploy on Wasmer Edge, import a repository on Wasmer: [![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=jktrn%2Fastro-erudite) The link imports this public template for a build and does not copy it into your GitHub account, so import the repository you created from this template instead to customize your site and redeploy on push.
